 "reason": "The inputs of the AAC, DTS and FLAC decoder vector suites (crates/codec-aac/tests/fate_vectors.rs, crates/codec-dca/tests/vectors.rs, crates/codec-flac/tests/vectors.rs), unpacked at the repository root of a gate host: the FATE AAC and DTS samples they read (.research/fate-samples/aac, .research/fate-samples/dts), each matching its source pin in harness/codecs/derived-streams.json; the IETF CELLAR FLAC test files (.research/flac-test-files subset, uncommon and faulty, CC0, github.com/ietf-wg-cellar/flac-test-files at aa7b0c6c) and the streams harness/codecs/flac/flac_vectors.py writes with the decode profile's ffmpeg and flac 1.4.3 (.research/flac-generated), each matching its codec manifest pin; and the AAC numeric comparison's 35 ADTS streams, copied from the codec-derived-streams set, beside the decode profile's float output of each (.research/aac-references, ffmpeg -f aac -i NAME.adts -f f32le -c:a pcm_f32le NAME.f32), which the gate's test step names in AAC_REF_DIR; the gate images are built with it",
